# ── AI chat assistant (server-side only — used by /api/chat) ──────────────────
# Required. Your OpenRouter API key (sk-or-v1-...). Set it in the Vercel project
# (Settings → Environment Variables) and here for local `vercel dev`.
# The endpoint and model are hard-coded in api/chat.ts (OpenRouter, qwen/qwen3.7-flash).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# ── Contact channel overrides (client-side, optional) ────────────────────────
# Defaults live in src/config/contact.ts
# VITE_CALENDLY_URL=https://calendly.com/your-username/30min
# VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=919876543210
# VITE_SIGNAL_URL=https://signal.me/#eu/yourusername
